        <mxCell id="footerText" parent="1" style="text;strokeColor=none;align=left;fillColor=none;html=1;fontColor=#c9d1d9;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=11;" value="1) Schema concerns split into Definition, Mapping, and Version Registry.&lt;br/&gt;2) Gateway decomposed into Gateway Entry and dedicated Execution Engine.&lt;br/&gt;3) Data API split into Command/Write and Query/Distribution surfaces to avoid read/write coupling.&lt;br/&gt;4) SDK drift mitigated through schema cache and compatibility guard.&lt;br/&gt;5) AttachedData and TemporarilyAttachedData made explicit as shared data backbone consumed by hosted APIs." vertex="1">
